### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### English farmer question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Will heavy rain affect my crops and what should I do?",
  "role": "farmer",
  "location": "Shimla, Himachal Pradesh",
  "language": "en"
}

### Hindi citizen question
POST http://localhost:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "क्या आज बाहर जाना सुरक्षित है?",
  "role": "citizen",
  "location": "Shimla, Himachal Pradesh",
  "language": "hi"
}

### Alert banner
GET http://localhost:8000/api/alerts?location=Shimla

### Subscribe to WhatsApp alerts
POST http://localhost:8000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "+919876543210",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "location": "Shimla",
  "role": "farmer"
}

### WhatsApp Sandbox webhook (configure Twilio to POST here)
# POST https://<ngrok-url>/whatsapp/webhook
# Send: Shimla: Will heavy rain affect my crops?